# Documentation + scripts (one-off migration scripts aren't deploy surface)
# Anchored to repo root: unanchored "scripts/" also glob-matched
# apps/server/src/scripts/ (backup-cron.ts, firestore-backup.ts,
# worker-healthcheck.ts - real runtime code, not one-off scripts), which
# silently dropped it from `railway up` CLI uploads and broke the esbuild
# bundle step with a confusing "entry point cannot be marked as external"
# error. GitHub-triggered Railway builds were unaffected (this file only
# governs the CLI upload path), so this never surfaced there.
